      {
        "name": "places/ChIJJcXDTwDxAzQReLKhSeYg_wo/reviews/ChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUNfeTlPNkFnEAE",
        "relativePublishTimeDescription": "1 年前",
        "rating": 1,
        "text": {
          "text": "兩天前，我在網路上預訂了一門課程，並提前15分鐘到達了教室。我發現教室裡空無一人，便去附近一家同名的咖啡館詢問。咖啡館的人要我到門口等候。到了10點，教室裡仍然空無一人，我又打電話過去，卻被告知老師並不知道有我的預訂。他們問我是什麼時候預訂的（兩天前），並告訴我如果我想上課，就得等一個多小時老師才會來。我選擇取消預訂，並請負責人退款。我認為他們人手不足，或者顧客太少，無法組織這門課。但是，作為顧客，我認為他們應該事先做好安排或通知。這是一次糟糕的經驗。",
          "languageCode": "zh-TW"
        },
        "originalText": {
          "text": "Two days ago, I booked a course online and arrived at the location 15 minutes early. Upon noticing that there was no one in the classroom, I inquired at a nearby café with the same name. They instructed me to wait at the door. By 10 o'clock, still with no one around, I called them again, only to be informed that the instructor was unaware of any reservation. I was asked when I had made the booking (two days ago) and was told that if I wanted to attend, I would have to wait for over an hour for the instructor to arrive. I chose to cancel and requested a refund from the person in charge. I don't believe they had enough staff or customers to organize the course. However, as a customer, I believe there should have been proper arrangements or advance notice. A horrible experience.",
          "languageCode": "en"
        },
